{"text": "eyesight", "etymologies": [{"etymologyHTML": "<p>From Middle English <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"enm\">ei\u021desiht</i>, <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"enm\">ie\u021desihte</i>, <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"enm\">ehsihthe</i>, <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"enm\">eihsihthe</i>, <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"enm\">e\u021dhesihthe</i>, equivalent to <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"en\">eye</i> +\u200e <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"en\">sight</i>.\n</p>", "pos": [{"pos": "Noun", "definitions": [{"definition": "Vision or the faculty of sight.", "quote": [], "relative": {}}, {"definition": "View or the range of vision.", "quote": [], "relative": {}}]}]}], "pronunciation": [["General American", "/\u02c8a\u026a\u02ccsa\u026at/"]]}